<title>USA: Nashville &amp; Davidson Cty, Tenn., yields 5.115 pct.</title>
<headline>Nashville &amp; Davidson Cty, Tenn., yields 5.115 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford  &amp; Co said it priced $34.515 million of Nashville and Davidson County Metropolitan Government, Tenn., general obligation refunding bonds, series 1996, with a top yield of 5.115 percent in 2010.</p>
</text>
